<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
